    <string name="tpl_35882540">分母相同，把分子相加。%1$s + %2$s = %3$s，答案是 %4$s/%5$s。</string>
    <string name="tpl_66531960">個位: %1$s + %2$s = %3$s %4$s\n答案是 %5$s。</string>
    <string name="tpl_93741444">冪的乘方，指數相乘。%1$s × %2$s = %3$s</string>
    <string name="tpl_a84fb314">每組 %1$s 個，共 %2$s 組。%3$s = %4$s\n%5$s 的乘法表: %6$s×%7$s=%8$s</string>
    <string name="tpl_40b5583a">數一數圖畫，一共有多少個?</string>
    <string name="tpl_4426d4f7">%1$s 加 %2$s 等於 %3$s。從 %4$s 開始再數 %5$s 個。</string>
    <string name="tpl_e8755f8c">一個一個數: %1$s，一共 %2$s 個。%3$s</string>
    <string name="tpl_412438c7">%1$s 個減去 %2$s 個，還剩 %3$s 個。</string>
    <string name="tpl_83f30dfe">%1$s 答案是 %2$s。</string>
    <string name="tpl_bf977bf4">把 %1$s 個平均分成 %2$s 組，每組 %3$s 個。\n檢驗: %4$s × %5$s = %6$s</string>
    <string name="tpl_9391fb31">先湊成10，再數剩下的: 10 + %1$s = %2$s 個。</string>
    <string name="tpl_9e616d48">數一數一共有多少個圖畫。</string>
    <string name="tpl_e94b638c">哪邊更多?</string>
    <string name="tpl_56861fce">把圖形拖到對應名字的籃子裡。(%1$s)</string>
    <string name="tpl_e2813a9a">%1$s = %2$s\n最大的質因數是 %3$s。</string>
    <string name="tpl_97c89890">某數乘 %1$s 再加 %2$s 得到 %3$s。\n這個數是多少?</string>
    <string name="tpl_ce982230">設這個數為 x: %1$sx + %2$s = %3$s\n%4$sx = %5$s\nx = %6$s</string>
    <string name="tpl_1fa89b68">當 f(x) = %1$s + %2$s %3$s 時，f\'(%4$s) 的值是?</string>
    <string name="tpl_91bf4e00">當 %1$sx %2$s = %3$s 時，x 是多少?</string>
    <string name="tpl_ee5eec9f">兩邊%2$s %1$s: %3$sx = %4$s\n兩邊同除以 %5$s，得 x = %6$s。</string>
    <string name="tpl_5c41b06f">先算乘法: %1$s × %2$s = %3$s，再算 %4$s + %5$s = %6$s</string>
    <string name="tpl_6a454edc">f(x) = %1$s %2$sx %3$s 除以 x %4$s 的餘數是?</string>
    <string name="tpl_dd646a18">餘數定理: f(x) 除以 (x - k) 的餘數是 f(k)。\nf(%1$s) = %2$s×%3$s %4$s %5$s×%6$s %7$s %8$s = %9$s</string>
    <string name="tpl_e163b535">%1$s/%2$s ÷ %3$s/%4$s = ? (最簡分數的分子)</string>
    <string name="tpl_f64e7111">除法就是把後面的分數顛倒再相乘。%1$s/%2$s × %3$s/%4$s = %5$s/%6$s\n約分後是 %7$s/%8$s。</string>
    <string name="tpl_593dd3e4">用加減消元法消去 y。\n第一式 × %1$s，第二式 × %2$s 後相減，得 x = %3$s\n代入得 y = %4$s。</string>
    <string name="tpl_69c8bd83">%1$sx + %2$sy = %3$s\n%4$sx + %5$sy = %6$s\n則 x 的值是?</string>
    <string name="tpl_856c631f">%1$s 和 %2$s 的公約數中最大的是 %3$s。</string>
    <string name="tpl_860d863a">把 %1$s 拆成 %2$s 和 %3$s 再相乘。\n%4$s×%5$s=%6$s，%7$s×%8$s=%9$s\n相加得 %10$s。</string>
    <string name="tpl_d0025612">%1$s 和 %2$s 的最大公約數是?</string>
    <string name="tpl_f0f11947">%1$s %2$sx %3$s = 0 的判別式 D 是多少?</string>
    <string name="tpl_2a17168e">%1$s 有 %3$s 個%2$s。\n朋友又給了 %4$s 個。\n現在%5$s一共有多少個?</string>
    <string name="tpl_4b6b9472">又得到了，所以用加法。\n%1$s + %2$s = %3$s 個</string>
    <string name="tpl_7182fe6c">%1$s 和 %2$s 中哪個數更大?</string>
    <string name="tpl_064cd500">%1$s 買了 %4$s 盒%2$s，每盒 %3$s 個。\n分掉 %5$s 個後還剩多少個?</string>
    <string name="tpl_b142acbe">先求總數: %1$s × %2$s = %3$s 個\n再減去分掉的: %4$s - %5$s = %6$s 個</string>
    <string name="tpl_09881b6d">把 %1$s/%2$s 化成最簡分數，分子是?</string>
    <string name="tpl_b9de180a">分子分母同除以最大公約數 %1$s: %2$s÷%3$s=%4$s，%5$s÷%6$s=%7$s\n答案是 %8$s/%9$s。</string>
    <string name="tpl_104b2419">兩邊%2$s %1$s: %3$sx &gt; %4$s\n兩邊同除以正數 %5$s，得 x &gt; %6$s\n(除以負數時不等號要反向!)</string>
    <string name="tpl_302b4ab7">%1$s ÷ %2$s 的餘數是?</string>
    <string name="tpl_7781a29b">%1$s ÷ %2$s = %3$s 餘 %4$s\n檢驗: %5$s × %6$s + %7$s = %8$s</string>
    <string name="tpl_421eaae2">當 x = %1$s 時，%2$sx + %3$s 的值是?</string>
    <string name="tpl_c746b533">把 x 換成 %1$s: %2$s × %3$s + %4$s = %5$s + %6$s = %7$s</string>
    <string name="tpl_520190ba">lim(x→%1$s) (%2$s %3$s) 的值是?</string>
    <string name="tpl_97b6e789">多項式函數連續，直接代入。%1$s×%2$s %3$s %4$s = %5$s</string>
    <string name="tpl_8154d16f">%1$s/%2$s × %3$s/%4$s = ? (最簡分數的分子)</string>
    <string name="tpl_8c032f04">分子乘分子，分母乘分母。%1$s×%2$s=%3$s，%4$s×%5$s=%6$s\n%7$s/%8$s 約分後是 %9$s/%10$s。</string>
    <string name="tpl_7b8145cd">%1$s × %2$s = %3$s\n%4$s × %5$s = %6$s\n相加得 %7$s。</string>
    <string name="tpl_d091ab21">移動小數點再計算。%1$s ÷ %2$s = %3$s</string>
    <string name="tpl_f5c65837">滿足 %1$sx %2$s &gt; %3$s 的 x 的範圍是 x &gt; ?</string>
    <string name="tpl_af55c367">%1$s 有 %3$s 個%2$s。\n給了弟弟 %4$s 個。\n還剩多少個%5$s?</string>
    <string name="tpl_836b321c">給出去了，所以用減法。\n%1$s - %2$s = %3$s 個</string>
    <string name="tpl_e48e2ef1">%1$s萬 後面有幾個 0? (1萬 = 10000)</string>
    <string name="tpl_2526ffa7">1萬 = 10000，有4個0。所以 %1$s萬 = %2$s。</string>
    <string name="tpl_dbc6233c">%1$s 以每小時 %2$s km 的速度走了 %3$s 小時。\n一共走了多少 km?</string>
    <string name="tpl_ddc5e7db">路程 = 速度 × 時間\n%1$s × %2$s = %3$s km</string>
    <string name="tpl_220e81e1">從刻度上讀出%1$s的條形高度是 %2$s。</string>
    <string name="tpl_c72ea029">%1$s的數值是多少?</string>
    <string name="tpl_3256a913">按大小排列後，中間的數就是中位數，即第三個數 %1$s。</string>
    <string name="tpl_36f716a4">%1$s 的中位數是?</string>
    <string name="tpl_829dc879">%1$s 的平均數是?</string>
    <string name="tpl_8caeb0c9">總和是 %1$s，共有 %2$s 個數據，所以 %3$s ÷ %4$s = %5$s。</string>
    <string name="tpl_3662d39b">%1$s + %2$s + %3$s = %4$s。</string>
    <string name="tpl_4729593b">%1$s 米 %2$s 厘米是多少厘米?</string>
    <string name="tpl_bc1684cd">1米是100厘米。%1$s米 = %2$s厘米，再加 %3$s厘米就是 %4$s厘米。</string>
    <string name="tpl_a04ee28d">%2$s 占 %1$s 的百分之幾?</string>
