    <string name="tpl_f2a44920">y = %1$s(x %2$s)² %3$s 的頂點橫坐標是?</string>
    <string name="tpl_accf5550">在 y = a(x-p)² + q 中，頂點是 (p, q)。\n頂點為 (%1$s, %2$s)，橫坐標是 %3$s。</string>
    <string name="tpl_ee1f2bd2">圓 (x %1$s)² + (y %2$s)² = %3$s 的半徑是?</string>
    <string name="tpl_c74c8c70">標準式 (x-a)² + (y-b)² = r² 中 r² = %1$s，故半徑為 %2$s。圓心是 (%3$s, %4$s)。</string>
